  {
   "address": 49664,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Space-padded text in eight 40-byte rows, followed by a zero at $C340, in the third-story snapshot. Its display routine remains to be traced."
  },
  {
   "address": 49984,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Zero byte after the eight 40-byte rows at $C200\u2013$C33F and before the next passage at $C341. The shared text routine at $1928 treats a zero at a row boundary as the end of a passage."
  },
  {
   "address": 49985,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Space-padded text in twelve 40-byte rows, followed by a zero at $C521, in the third-story snapshot. Its display routine remains to be traced."
  },
  {
   "address": 57344,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Use A to select a seven-byte record at $EB5C: one accumulator increment and three little-endian pointers. Clear the three $24-byte channel state blocks, initialize their pointers and counters from the selected record, clear SID registers, and enable the channel update flags."
  },
  {
   "address": 57658,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Call the three-voice SID update at $E141, then call the separate routine at $E937 before returning."
  },
  {
   "address": 57674,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Immediate operand of the ADC at $E149 and the accumulator for the sound update. Initialization writes $FF here; the update stores each sum back. Carry from the addition controls whether it advances the three channel streams."
  },
  {
   "address": 57894,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Entry 0 in the little-endian command jump table at $E226 holds $E2B1. The dispatcher at $E42C reads an indexed pair from this table."
